# Oracle content — a single encrypted archive (oracle.enc); the plaintext is
# gitignored and restored via oracle/decrypt.sh (XYD_CONTENT_SECRET).
#
# Moved here verbatim from packages/xyd-openapi2opencli/.gitignore when that
# package was deleted. It MUST travel with the archive: without it, running
# decrypt.sh leaves the decrypted oracle unignored, and the next `git add -A`
# commits vendored plaintext permanently.
oracle/*
!oracle/oracle.enc
!oracle/encrypt.sh
!oracle/decrypt.sh
